# Python / QML

- Automation Center: PySide6 + QML in `desktop/automation-center/ambar_center/`. Tests run offscreen against a real `ambard`: `QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen python3 -m pytest desktop/automation-center/tests` (build `ambard` first with `cargo build`).
- Pass user text to the CLI after `--` so it can never be parsed as a flag (tested).
- Python 3.11+, type hints, standard library first. No new runtime dependencies in `ambar_sdk`.
- Light and dark themes must both meet WCAG AA contrast for text.
